AIM: Develop a simple JSP application to display values obtained from the use of intrinsic objects of various types.

FILE: index.jsp

<%@page contentType="text/html" pageEncoding="UTF-8"%>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>

    <h1>Simple JSP Intrinsic Objects Demo</h1>

    <h3>1. The 'request' Object</h3>
    <p>Your IP Address is: <%= request.getRemoteAddr() %></p>
    <p>You used the method: <%= request.getMethod() %></p>

    <h3>2. The 'session' Object</h3>
    <p>Your unique Session ID is: <%= session.getId() %></p>

    <h3>3. The 'application' Object</h3>
    <p>The server software running this code is:
        <%= application.getServerInfo() %>
    </p>

    <h3>4. The 'out' Object</h3>
    <p>
        <% out.print("<b>Hello! This bold text was printed using out.print().</b>"); %>
    </p>

</body>
</html>


